#. Tag: title
#: using-setup-plugins.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Plugins Settings"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-plugins.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Kipi is an Image Plugin Interface. It is an interface that is supported by a "
"number of image viewer/editor applications. By providing this interface, "
"&digikam; can take advantage of many plugins that are written to work with "
"any application that implements the Kipi interface."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-plugins.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If your operating system has the Kipi plugins package installed, you will "
"see a list of available plugins. Select those that you want to use and they "
"will be loaded into &digikam;. The plugins will appear as new menu entries "
"in the main menu bar and in the context menu for thumbnails."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-setup-plugins.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Keyboard shortcuts to actions that plugins perform can be set up in the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Setting</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Shortcuts</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu."
msgstr ""

#~ msgid "Color Management"
#~ msgstr "Xestión de color"
